{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"とうとうタイトルから日常の文字がが消えた。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/20/6305841/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新空いちゃってごめんなさい（；＿；）うぎ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17日に、東北楽天ゴールデンイーグルスさんの応援でね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、まいやんちゃんの始球式リベンジを果たすためにね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮城に行ってきましたーはぁい❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は～、生田さんのアンダーとしてガールズルール踊らせてもらっいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まーくんこと田中将大投手、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生で見てすごくオチャメな方なんだなと思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもあの豪速球の球を真剣な表情で投げてるあのイメージしかなかったので。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたくしは自然と顔が笑顔になってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/20/6305841/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはちがう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、まいやんの始球式リベンジ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのねえ、あれは見てて思ったがねぇ、とてもじゃない緊張感だよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみだったら緊張の高まりが最高潮に達して、フクロウがたまに細長くなるじゃん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーいうふうにあみもなっちゃうと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見事なリベンジだったよ、おつかれまいやんちやん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぎうぎ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、はじめて夜中にDVD三本いっぺんに見てしまった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「悪の教典」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「桐島、部活やめるってよ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「オズ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれも面白くて釘ずけになってじまった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悪の教典は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤英明さんが海猿のときのイメージを忘れさせるほどの演技の変わりようにびっくらどっこいしょって感じだった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも...あれはなかなかだね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"血、血。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもあみわりかしちょっとグロテスクな感じのとか嫌いじゃあないんだよね( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"ty